# hair/adult/longwavy: Long wavy: parted in the middle, waves of lit locks framing the face and falling past the shoulders to
# mid-back (a volume style: up to 18 px); the ears hidden. The ends hang and swing: longwavy_hang.
# P2b wave 2, HAIR. On the adult head box (STYLE_P2 21; man and woman). Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
use person
body adult
role hair longwavy
layer hairFront
anchor head
keys hairpose

